  ('1e90123c-c90e-469b-ba20-664136c613b5','Big Sioux JOAD in Brookings, South Dakota is affiliated with USA Archery and built around the Junior Olympic Archery Development pathway, the national system that introduces kids to Olympic-style recurve and compound shooting with an eye toward progressing through regional and national levels. Alongside the youth program, the club also runs an Adult Archery Program, giving grown-up beginners and returning shooters a structured way to learn form and safety rather than figuring it out alone. That combination of junior and adult tracks under one USA Archery-affiliated roof makes it a reasonable first stop for a Brookings-area family with archers of different ages.'),
