  ('99783614-eb0e-4caf-9e32-82052e0d5974','Black Eagle Bowman, located in Howard, Pennsylvania, is listed in the IBO directory as an affiliated pro shop, tying it into the International Bowhunting Organization''s network of retailers that cater to 3D and bowhunting-focused archers. Being an IBO pro shop typically means a focus on hunting and 3D competition gear, tuning, and setup rather than purely recreational walk-in shooting, though this listing doesn''t detail lane count or on-site range specifics. Howard sits in Centre County, in central Pennsylvania''s heavily wooded hunting country, where a shop with IBO ties would likely see strong seasonal interest from bowhunters. Confirming current services and hours directly with the shop is the best next step.'),
